  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "半分はこの売り上げです  (Half Came From These Sales)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the start of the season finale of The Naked Director, Kuroki debates Japanese culture on television while Muranishi savors warm soup at the office and asks Kawada how his huge bail was paid.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしは日本の風潮に問題があると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "日本には恥じらいの文化がございますが、縛られる必要はございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしのテーマは愛でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いやあ、しかしみんなまだ慣れんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、うまい。みそ汁だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木君は変わったな。何でこんな話してんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺の保釈金は？どうやって用意したんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "半分はこの売り上げです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一体どれだけ売れたんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "およそ五千万。でもまだまだ伸びてますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "利子をつけて返すよ。これから休みなく働いてもらうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "食べ終わったら祝いに行きますよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしは日本の風潮に問題があると思っております。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I believe there is a problem with Japan's current social climate.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "日本には恥じらいの文化がございますが、縛られる必要はございません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Japan has a culture of modesty, yet there is no need to be bound by it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "わたくしのテーマは愛でございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My personal theme is love.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いやあ、しかしみんなまだ慣れんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Man, I still cannot get used to how everyone looks now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、うまい。みそ汁だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ah, delicious. Real miso soup.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木君は変わったな。何でこんな話してんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kuroki has changed so much. Why is she talking so formally?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺の保釈金は？どうやって用意したんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What about my bail money? How did you put it together?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "半分はこの売り上げです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Half of it came from the sales of her video.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一体どれだけ売れたんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just how much did it sell?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "およそ五千万。でもまだまだ伸びてますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Roughly fifty million yen, and sales are still climbing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "利子をつけて返すよ。これから休みなく働いてもらうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will pay the rest back with interest. Everyone will work nonstop from now on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "食べ終わったら祝いに行きますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once we finish eating, we are heading out to celebrate.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
